text": "Conferidas, as notas seguem por um caminho interno de correias e rolos… até a abertura. E o dinheiro chega na sua mão.", "start": 75.32, "end": 83.34, "words": [{"w": "Conferidas,", "start": 75.32, "end": 75.92}, {"w": "as", "start": 76.3, "end": 76.44}, {"w": "notas", "start": 76.44, "end": 76.78}, {"w": "seguem", "start": 76.78, "end": 77.18}, {"w": "por", "start": 77.18, "end": 77.36}, {"w": "um", "start": 77.36, "end": 77.5}, {"w": "caminho", "start": 77.5, "end": 77.7}, {"w": "interno", "start": 77.7, "end": 78.42}, {"w": "de", "start": 78.42, "end": 78.6}, {"w": "correias", "start": 78.6, "end": 79.18}, {"w": "e", "start": 79.18, "end": 79.32}, {"w": "rolos…", "start": 79.32, "end": 79.72}, {"w": "até", "start": 79.94, "end": 80.52}, {"w": "a", "start": 80.52, "end": 80.7}, {"w": "abertura.", "start": 80.7, "end": 81.26}, {"w": "E", "start": 81.6, "end": 81.76}, {"w": "o", "start": 81.76, "end": 81.8}, {"w": "dinheiro", "start": 81.8, "end": 82.1}, {"w": "chega", "start": 82.1, "end": 82.72}, {"w": "na", "start": 82.72, "end": 82.94}, {"w": "sua", "start": 82.94, "end": 83.12}, {"w": "mão.", "start": 83.12, "end": 83.34}]}, {"text": "E quem coloca o dinheiro lá dentro? Profissionais autorizados, que trocam ou abastecem os cassetes, com tudo conferido.", "start": 83.78, "end": 91.74, "words": [{"w": "E", "start": 83.78, "end": 83.96}, {"w": "quem", "start": 83.96, "end": 84.24}, {"w": "coloca", "start": 84.24, "end": 84.66}, {"w": "o", "start": 84.66, "end": 84.88}, {"w": "dinheiro", "start": 84.88, "end": 85.14}, {"w": "lá", "start": 85.14, "end": 85.38}, {"w": "dentro?", "start": 85.38, "end": 85.68}, {"w": "Profissionais", "start": 85.68, "end": 86.76}, {"w": "autorizados,", "start": 86.76, "end": 87.64}, {"w": "que", "start": 87.64, "end": 88.04}, {"w": "trocam", "start": 88.04, "end": 88.62}, {"w": "ou", "start": 88.62, "end": 88.84}, {"w": "abastecem", "start": 88.84, "end": 89.54}, {"w": "os", "start": 89.54, "end": 89.68}, {"w": "cassetes,", "st